---
/** The small second frame beside the oval (Stage 5 B1 task 2, a3 minor C3): an
    arched gilt frame, a blue bird study on a bough in the same hand as the
    wall. It hangs from a cord to a gilt nail with a little rosette round it.
    The bough, bird and leaves are the shapes of ChinoiserieShapes.astro. */
---
<div class="gm-frame2" aria-hidden="true"><div class="mat"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 125" focusable="false"><path class="sc-limb" d="M-6 84C20 78 44 80 60 76C78 72 96 74 108 64L108 69C94 79 78 78 60 82C44 86 20 85-6 91Z"/><use href="#sc-pb" class="sc-birdB" transform="translate(60 78) scale(.52)"/><use href="#sc-l1" transform="translate(16 88) rotate(96) scale(.8)"/><use href="#sc-l2" transform="translate(28 84) rotate(80) scale(.7)"/><use href="#sc-l1" transform="translate(40 83) rotate(104) scale(.65)"/><use href="#sc-l2" transform="translate(82 79) rotate(88) scale(.8)"/><use href="#sc-l1" transform="translate(94 74) rotate(100) scale(.75)"/><use href="#sc-ck" transform="translate(70 82) rotate(4) scale(.9)"/><use href="#sc-l2" transform="translate(6 70) rotate(-70) scale(.7)"/><use href="#sc-l1" transform="translate(98 52) rotate(-110) scale(.7)"/></svg></div></div>

<style>
  .gm-frame2 {
    position: absolute; z-index: 3;
    right: -16%; bottom: -3%;
    width: 36%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    padding: 6px;
    background: var(--gilt);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 245 210 / 0.6), inset 0 0 0 3px rgb(122 90 28 / 0.3), 0 14px 22px -10px rgb(20 10 4 / 0.6);
  }
  .mat {
    position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%;
    background: radial-gradient(closest-side, var(--oval), color-mix(in srgb, var(--oval), var(--ornament) 14%));
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px var(--ornament-deep), inset 0 3px 8px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.3);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .mat svg { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
  /* The cord it hangs from, leaning off true, and the nail it ends on. */
  .gm-frame2::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 100%;
    width: 1px; height: 2.5rem;
    background: var(--ornament-deep);
    rotate: 18deg; transform-origin: 50% 100%;
  }
  /* The cord's top end is 2.5rem along its lean: sin(18deg) across, cos(18deg) up. */
  .gm-frame2::after {
    content: ''; position: absolute;
    left: calc(50% + 0.7725rem - 5px); bottom: calc(100% + 2.378rem - 5px);
    width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #f6e6ac, #c9a24c 50%, #7a5a1c);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgb(184 147 63 / 0.55), 0 0 0 3px rgb(122 90 28 / 0.35), 0 2px 3px rgb(30 16 6 / 0.5);
  }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .gm-frame2 { right: -22%; bottom: -4%; width: 38%; }
  }
</style>
